### 5.3  Learning Management System

The top management shall incorporate an integrated learning management system (LMS) to ensure enhanced learning experiences. The LMS shall have the following features:

- a) Tools to create, organize, and manage courses within the online platform;
- b) Various types of multimedia content such as videos, presentations, documents, quizzes, and interactive activities as applicable;
- c) Easy accessibility and irretrievability of e-resources;
- d) Defined schedule with step wise roll-out of learning program;
- e) Tracking mechanisms to monitor learner's progress within courses, including completion status, quiz scores, and time
