- b) Use of meaningful username specially during live sessions;
- c) Restriction on imposter in exams and live sessions;
- d) How and where to keep receiving device (laptop or phone) for better reception;
- e) Maintain data integrity of shared portal resources;
- f) How to use device and online coaching platform during lectures; and
